  "title": "Blini (Russian Pancakes)",
  "description": "This blinchiki or blini recipe makes delicate pancakes for filling with caviar, jam, or sour cream, widely served during Russia&#39;s Maslenitsa festival.",
  "authors": [
    "Kangaroo495"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-18T23:43:33-04:00",
  "date_modified": "2026-05-27T11:18:24-04:00",
  "prep_time": "PT15M",
  "cook_time": "PT30M",
  "total_time": "PT65M",
  "yield": [
    "6",
    "20 blinis"
  ],
  "categories": [
    "Breakfast"
  ],
  "cuisines": [
    "Russian"
  ],
  "regions": [
    "Russian"
  ],
  "breadcrumbs": [],
  "keywords": [],
  "ingredients": [
    "4.25 cups milk",
    "5 large eggs",
    "2 tablespoons white sugar",
    "0.33333334326744 teaspoon salt",
    "0.5 teaspoon baking soda",
    "0.125 teaspoon citric acid powder",
    "4 cups all-purpose flour",
    "3 tablespoons vegetable oil",
    "1 cup boiling water",
    "0.66666668653488 cup butter, divided"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Pvct3BbkVXP38CplFrbdH0lQPHs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-215962-blini-russian-pancakes-ddmfs-step1-3x4-dfb2bfa6f9e44ac18dca34e184e5622a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/215962/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat together milk and eggs in a large bowl until combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/hpUm9pK3cgrL9ull-5s3j4zJ0wo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-215962-blini-russian-pancakes-ddmfs-step2-3x4-7f09b38b8ac04a3ab4420f03cecb4f38.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/215962/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat in sugar and salt. Mix in baking soda and citric acid until incorporated.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/oO27xXcKgzeVcUQMWlMacJi9dyI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-215962-blini-russian-pancakes-ddmfs-step3-3x4-6152fa3d56cd4d59a34905ae2407c90a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/215962/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Blend in flour, a little at a time, until combined. Beat in oil. Pour in boiling water, stirring constantly, until batter is thin and watery. Let rest for about 20 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/h7YdCgZQI7Ha1x3EMONIpd1G4LQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-215962-blini-russian-pancakes-ddmfs-step5-3x4-6f9318d35ee84245aa721fa0e1e12a65.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/215962/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Brush a small frying pan with 1 tablespoon melted butter over medium-high heat. Pick the pan up off the heat. Pour in a ladleful of batter while you rotate your wrist, tilting the pan, so batter forms a circle and coats the bottom. The blini should be very thin.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ojelQp-Rb-8iU19jNWM--_1bD1k=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-215962-blini-russian-pancakes-ddmfs-step6-3x4-609cc88c075c4e7291e47539763f6cbc.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/215962/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Return the pan to the heat. Cook blini for 90 seconds. Carefully lift up edge of blini to see if it's fully cooked: edges will be golden and bottom surface should have brown spots.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/LTw3GtiLfTsusdPp994lQ0u5AjU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-215962-blini-russian-pancakes-ddmfs-step7-3x4-f630160e5a61400cbe914e29d018cc02.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/215962/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Flip blini over and cook for 1 minute more.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/RXreMNlbBgMMAtF_U02GM01f_nM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-215962-blini-russian-pancakes-ddmfs-step8-3x4-b729e950e7b843ad9ae14a269b10674b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/215962/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer blini to a plate lined with a clean kitchen towel.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/nMWrjW7wCcmvjTEDGa8TEwxiY3Q=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-215962-blini-russian-pancakes-ddmfs-step9-3x4-5a82fe5bbfe2438e94215505eec061d5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/215962/step_08.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Continue cooking remaining batter, adding 1 tablespoon butter to the pan for every 4 blinis. Stack blinis and cover with another kitchen towel to keep warm.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Ibg2Ykg0gGGDRVo0tIZYf45FfsY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-215962-blini-russian-pancakes-ddmfs-step10-3x4-b5abd13d8d884c7e92fe0272e02b62f8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/215962/step_09.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread desired filling in the center of each blini.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/_AVPjCzk5kxr8tgpk0GDgVIzpfk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-215962-blini-russian-pancakes-ddmfs-step11-3x4-98d5b40115c443e4a24027fd51aa0716.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/215962/step_10.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fold 3 times to make a triangle shape or fold up all 4 sides, like a small burrito.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/JENgSBxfXgK01CBXC4KcL_hXszo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-215962-blini-russian-pancakes-ddmfs-step12-2-3x4-e03a733c833643f6b94ee5d35c02b5a9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/215962/step_11.webp"
    }
  ],
